@startuml Procesamiento_asincrono_con_Lambda_EventBridge_y_SQS
title Procesamiento asíncrono con Lambda, EventBridge y SQS
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F9F8F5
  BorderColor #01696F
  ArrowColor #707070
}

class DomainEvent <<abstract>> {
  +UUID eventId
  +String eventType
  +DateTime occurredAt
  +String source
}

class EventEnvelope {
  +UUID id
  +String correlationId
  +String payloadJson
  +Integer retryCount
}

class EventBridgeAdapter <<Outbound Adapter>> {
  +publish(event)
}

class SqsAdapter <<Outbound Adapter>> {
  +sendMessage(envelope)
  +receiveMessage()
}

class LambdaMoodleHandler <<AWS Lambda>> {
  +handleSchedule()
}

class LambdaInteraccionesHandler <<AWS Lambda>> {
  +handleSqsMessage()
}

class LambdaAlertasHandler <<AWS Lambda>> {
  +handleEvent()
}

class LambdaRecursosHandler <<AWS Lambda>> {
  +handleS3Event()
}

class MoodleApiPort <<Output Port>> {
  +getCourses()
  +getActivities()
  +getGrades()
  +getEvents()
}

class TrazabilidadRepositoryPort <<Output Port>> {
  +saveInteraccion()
  +findProgreso()
}

class XaiRepositoryPort <<Output Port>> {
  +saveAlertaExplicable()
}

class RecursoRepositoryPort <<Output Port>> {
  +actualizarMetadata()
}

DomainEvent --> EventEnvelope : se_envuelve
EventBridgeAdapter --> EventEnvelope : publica
EventEnvelope --> SqsAdapter : se_enruta
SqsAdapter --> LambdaInteraccionesHandler : dispara
LambdaMoodleHandler --> MoodleApiPort : extrae datos LMS
LambdaInteraccionesHandler --> TrazabilidadRepositoryPort : actualiza interacciones
LambdaAlertasHandler --> TrazabilidadRepositoryPort : consulta progreso
LambdaAlertasHandler --> XaiRepositoryPort : registra alerta explicable
LambdaRecursosHandler --> RecursoRepositoryPort : actualiza metadatos
@enduml
